{%- comment -%}
  FlushGut typography — Archivo.

  The 2026 design comp is set in Archivo SemiBold (display) with Acumin Variable
  Concept for body copy. Acumin is an Adobe font with no web licence available to
  this store; Archivo is a near-identical neo-grotesque and is served free by
  Google Fonts, so it carries both roles.

  Loaded via <link> rather than an @import inside <style>: an @import in a style
  block blocks rendering until the sheet resolves, which is what the previous
  DM Sans setup did.
{%- endcomment -%}
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link rel="stylesheet"
      href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Archivo:wght@400;500;600;700;800&display=swap">
